# Assistant content: an ordered list. internal/tui/markdown.go's
# Enumeration style glues the numeral straight onto the item with a ". "
# separator (its own comment: no Enumeration style configured would render
# "1Point me..." with no separator at all, so this is the specific thing
# to check for).
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-ordered.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE explain the change
KEY enter
WAITFOR /the eleventh/ 20
SHOT reply
EXPECT /1\. Start the server/
EXPECT /2\. Send eleven requests in a minute/
EXPECT /3\. Observe the 429 on the eleventh/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
